<h3><u>Haaye beemar</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">haaye beemar x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Haaye beemar mera bediyo wala bhaiyya x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Haa yateemi me mere naaz uthata bhaiyya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Haaye beemar mera bediyo wala bhaiyya x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">1. Raahe purkhaar me kuch mujko aziyat na mili<br />
Sehli takleef to lekin meri gardan na khichi<br />
Bas yahi soch ke phir sar na uthaya bhaiyya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">2. Payr jalte the mere bhai ke har gaam magar<br />
Dhup me jalti zameen per mai kadam rakhti jidhar<br />
Apne saaye se waha saaya banata bhaiyya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">3. Jab tamache muje lagte to wo ruk jaata wahi<br />
Chhod kar mujko use durre lagate the laeen<br />
Durre khud khaake muje unse bachata bhaiyya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">4. Seenae shah pe sone ki sada aadi thi<br />
Zakhmi rukhsar zameen per nahi rakh paati thi<br />
Haaye zakhmi seene pe muje apne sulata bhaiyya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">5. Qabr ki tarha se taarik tha zindaane jafa<br />
Mujko zindaan ke andhero se jo dar lagta tha<br />
Apne ashko se waha karta ujaala bhaiyya</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">6. Baat bas meesumo salman ye ehsaas ki hai<br />
Yu dua karti thi shahzaadi rihaayi ke liye<br />
Kaise haatho se bandhe qabr banata bhaiyya</p>
</p>